==Notes==
*Throwing axes can be used with a [[shield]].
*Throwing axes are automatically [[mighty]] up to the character's [[strength]] modifier.
*The weight of a full stack (50 lbs) often incurs [[encumbrance]] concerns.

==Toolset==
* Throwing axes are listed in the [[throwing blueprint category]] on the [[item palette]] of the [[toolset]].